VUE_APP_TITLE=XiaoZhi Control Panel
VUE_APP_DESCRIPTION=The XiaoZhi backend service (xiaozhi-server) is the backend of an intelligent terminal hardware/software system led by Prof. Liu Siyuan's team at South China University of Technology. Built for the open-source xiaozhi-esp32 hardware, it offers multi-protocol support, voiceprint recognition, knowledge base management and other core capabilities.
VUE_APP_KEYWORDS=xiaozhi-server, XiaoZhi server, XiaoZhi control panel, AI hardware, smart hardware, AI toys, emotional companionship, chatbot, smart home, in-car robot
